      "text_resolved": "NEW: Statement on Supreme Court Title 42 Order ⬇️ \n\nhttps://www.dhs.gov/news/2022/12/27/statement-department-homeland-security-supreme-court-title-42-order https://t.co/c2OSQ1Nvd5",
